msgid "CHANGE_ORGANISM_MEMBRANE_TYPE"
msgstr "Change Membrane Type"

msgid "CHANGE_ORGANISM_MEMBRANE_TYPE_EXPLANATION"
msgstr ""
"Changing membrane type is still possible in the Multicellular Stage, but much harder.\n"
"In the Macroscopic Stage it will not be possible any more to change membrane type at all.\n"
"Changing the membrane now requires all cell types to change at once to the new type.\n"
"This requires all mutation points [thrive:icon]MP[/thrive:icon] to be spent on this change.\n"
"And this will exit the editor to apply the change.\n"
"Change membranes to the selected type?"

msgid "CHANGE_ORGANISM_MEMBRANE_TYPE_EXPLANATION_NOT_ENOUGH_MP"
msgstr ""
"Changing membrane type is still possible in the Multicellular Stage, but much harder.\r\n"
"In the Macroscopic Stage it will not be possible any more to change membrane type at all.\r\n"
"Changing the membrane now requires all cell types to change at once to the new type.\r\n"
"This requires all mutation points [thrive:icon]MP[/thrive:icon] to be spent on this change.\r\n"
"And this will exit the editor to apply the change.\r\n"
"[b]Not enough MP.[/b] You can undo all changes if you need to change the membrane."

